# Filmes — /api/movies/
# {tmdb_id} é o id do filme no TMDB (o mesmo que vem na busca). 603 = Matrix.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@tmdbId = 603

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "twist_demo",
  "password": "Tw1st!Senha#Forte"
}

###
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.access}}

### Buscar filmes no TMDB (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/search/?q=matrix&page=1

### Detalhes do filme (público; com token, inclui o estado do usuário em user_state)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Marcar como assistido
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/watch/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Remover de assistidos
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/watch/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Adicionar à lista "Quero assistir"
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/watchlist/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Remover da lista "Quero assistir"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/watchlist/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Avaliar (1 a 5 estrelas; PUT e PATCH fazem o mesmo)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/rating/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stars": 5
}

### Remover avaliação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/rating/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Curtir (LIKE) ou dar deslike (DISLIKE)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/reaction/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reaction": "LIKE"
}

### Remover reação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/{{tmdbId}}/reaction/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
